  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Child and Forced Labor Research for Policy Impact: Catalyzing Actionable Research to Reduce Child and Forced Labor in Central America</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the project is to identify solutions to address child labor, forced labor and related determinants through the co-creation of impact evaluation research, with a focus on Central America.</narrative>
